{"title":"AI Clinic 02: Can AI actually do this? Bring the task and find out","startsAt":"2026-10-21T18:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-21T20:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Everybody has a task they have quietly wondered about. The one where you think *surely a computer could do this by now*, and then you never find out, because asking felt like it would turn into a sales call.\n\nThis is where you ask.\n\nSame format every month. Everyone names one job they keep doing by hand, all of it goes on a board, and it gets sorted in front of the room into **do it yourself this week**, **a weekend project**, or **needs help, or leave it alone**. Then three or four get taken apart properly: the approach, the tool, roughly the cost, what breaks.\n\nEvery bottleneck in the room gets sorted out loud and gets a first step. Some of these are a ten minute job, some are a real project, and some are not worth doing. You will be told which.\n\nYou get a straight answer, including when the answer is no. Some things are not worth automating and you deserve to hear that too.\n\n**The night**\n\n* 6:00 Doors, coffee, write your bottleneck on a card\n* 6:15 Round the table, sixty seconds each\n* 6:35 The board\n* 6:50 Three or four worked through properly\n* 7:20 Networking\n* 8:00 Out\n\n**Who should come**\n\nAny owner or operator with a repetitive job and no idea whether it can be handed over. New faces and returning ones both, and if you came last month, bring the next one down your list.\n\n**What to bring**\n\nOne task, described specifically. No laptop.\n\n**Cost** Free.\n\n**When:** Wednesday 21 October 2026, 6:00 to 8:00 pm.\n\n**Where:** 30 Topflight Drive, Mississauga. Follow the signs to the offices when you arrive. Doors at 6:00, and it is worth being there for the round the table at 6:15 because that is where your bottleneck goes on the board.","venue":{"name":"30 Topflight Drive","address":"30 Topflight Dr., Mississauga","lat":43.65024,"lng":-79.71096,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":null,"group":"Build with AI, Mississauga","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/c/2/b/highres_535608171.jpeg"}